  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">凱爾卡的可合成動物模組</span></h1><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">你好！這個模組讓你能夠合成《我的世界》中的所有生物。同時也提供了合成生成器的可能性。<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請使用JEI查看當前的合成配方。</span><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://sun9-51.userapi.com/impg/GtASYkNuTFNfTT-hAkYq4jocIiiQYAF6jNPfnw/NUQLofSftNw.jpg?size=847x527&amp;quality=95&amp;sign=51dc8b35408b0d791c8be9bc14d62904&amp;type=album\"><img src=\"https://sun9-77.userapi.com/impg/LPCwLTZ_gAFIkkBW_n6XS16xzHn-Q4Z7efOGCg/zzduR3GapGw.jpg?size=834x527&amp;quality=95&amp;sign=7191851fed67ca971def21336093a991&amp;type=album\"><img src=\"https://sun9-41.userapi.com/impg/kMbFC9jTnqIvuUtOPREvQSms2VPmk2IYcfucxQ/r6o9SASwmtQ.jpg?size=829x521&amp;quality=95&amp;sign=d62165593badc0652e6e68b98f3ca752&amp;type=album\"><img src=\"https://sun9-29.userapi.com/impg/nUZQ07A0pNyx1uSXoyelBdRoGYmP1cMhHUaxvg/T04YNFGzpV0.jpg?size=834x525&amp;quality=95&amp;sign=010cb69fe9b2b754adaa5285e92c86d4&amp;type=album\"></p>",
